{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Materialize\/batch(strategy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Batch","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchStrategy","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"strategy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When to emit the gathered elements; its "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence’s, inferred from the call."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the upstream’s elements, in order, in arrays of one or more."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The strategy decides when the pending elements are flushed: every so many elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), every interval","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), on a signal or a unit of work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), whenever any of several does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), or by a rule of your own (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"). After every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flush, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence never emits an empty array.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the upstream finishes, the pending elements, if any, are emitted as a last array and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sequence finishes. When the upstream throws, the pending elements are dropped and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence throws the same error. A signal that finishes stops firing while the batches go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on; a signal that throws ends the sequence with its error.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream and the strategy run in tasks of their own, started when iteration begins,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and arrays the consumer hasn’t taken yet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are buffered. Cancelling the consumer, or dropping its iterator, cancels both. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"upstream or signal that ignores cancellation keeps the internal task alive until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pending "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" returns, and is not read again after that; the batched sequence itself"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends at once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["for try await batch in [1, 2, 3, 4].async.batch(strategy: .either(.count(3), .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock()))) {","    print(batch) \/\/ Prints [1, 2, 3], then [4]","}"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any error the upstream or the strategy throws.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Materialize"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Batch","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5BatchV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Strategy"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","modules":[{"name":"Afluent","relatedModules":["_Concurrency"]}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5batch8strategyAA14AsyncSequencesO5BatchVy_xqd__Gqd___tAA0H8StrategyRd__ACQyd__ADRSlF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO11MaterializeV","symbolKind":"method","conforma